  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector Support Program: Programme Sectoriel Eau etAssainissement (PROSEA) - PROSEA Tech Ass. COWI</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sektorst&#xf6;d vatten PROSEA (Programme Sectoriel Eau et Assainissement)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Dansk/svenskt gemens. sektorprogramst&#xf6;d 3 reg. i Mali . M&#xe5;l: uppn&#xe5;    Milleniumm&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r vatten och sanitet- tillg&#xe5;ng samt att ha en        h&#xe5;llbar vattenresursf&#xf6;rvaltning.3 komponenter, 1 dricksvatten, 2      sanitet latriner/skoltoaletter/ hygienundervisn.3, integrerad         vattenresurshantering. Sida &#xe4;r ansvarig f&#xf6;r teknisk assistanc f&#xf6;r     komp 3, Danmark f&#xf6;r  1 o 2. Planerat &#xf6;verg&#xe5; till sektorbudgst. 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">sector support to three regions in mali with the aim to enter into    sector budget support from 2012. objective: reach the MDGs on water   and sanitation coverage, and to achieve a sustainable water resources management. one comp drinking water, one sanitation, one IWRM. Sida   resp for TA in IWRM, danes resp for the other TAs. coordinated w JFA  w denmark.</narrative>
  </description>
